  <h1>Community Standards &amp; communication privacy</h1>
  <p>These standards apply to Live Chat, support tickets, email, text messages, phone calls, and other communications with our team.</p>
  <h2>Protect your privacy</h2>
  <p>Do not share protected health information in Live Chat or public support forms. Do not send Social Security numbers, payment card details, medical records, diagnoses, or treatment details here. Use your secure patient or client portal for health information, or ask our team how to send it securely.</p>
